#: templates/official_names_review.html:96
msgid "Fill empty fields with AI"
msgstr "Isi kolom kosong dengan AI"

#: templates/official_names_review.html:99
msgid ""
"AI Fill for many games at once. The AI fills each game's empty fields, "
"such as genre, release dates and copies sold, the same way the AI Fill "
"button on a game's page does, and saves them straight to the game. Games "
"AI Fill has already done are skipped, so a second run only does the rest."
msgstr ""
"Isi dengan AI untuk banyak game sekaligus. AI mengisi kolom kosong setiap"
" game, seperti genre, tanggal rilis, dan kopi terjual, sama seperti "
"tombol Isi dengan AI di halaman game, lalu menyimpannya langsung ke game."
" Game yang sudah pernah melalui Isi dengan AI dilewati, jadi proses kedua"
" hanya mengerjakan sisanya."

#: templates/official_names_review.html:100
msgid ""
"Your AI provider charges for each game. With Claude Haiku 5.5 and web "
"search on, a game costs at most about 5 US cents."
msgstr ""
"Penyedia AI Anda menagih biaya untuk setiap game. Dengan Claude Haiku 5.5"
" dan pencarian web aktif, satu game paling banyak sekitar 5 sen AS."

#: templates/official_names_review.html:102
msgid "Fields to fill"
msgstr "Kolom yang diisi"

#: templates/official_names_review.html:103
msgid ""
"Only the fields switched on are filled, and only games with one of them "
"empty are counted. Fewer fields cost less."
msgstr ""
"Hanya kolom yang diaktifkan yang diisi, dan hanya game dengan salah "
"satunya kosong yang dihitung. Semakin sedikit kolom, semakin murah."

#: templates/official_names_review.html:105
msgid "All on"
msgstr "Semua aktif"

#: templates/official_names_review.html:106
msgid "All off"
msgstr "Semua mati"

#: templates/official_names_review.html:124
msgid "Include games AI Fill has already done"
msgstr "Sertakan game yang sudah pernah melalui Isi dengan AI"

#: templates/official_names_review.html:126
msgid ""
"Turn this on to fill a field in games done before, such as copies sold "
"after turning on web search. Those games are charged again."
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan ini untuk mengisi kolom pada game yang sudah dikerjakan "
"sebelumnya, seperti kopi terjual setelah pencarian web diaktifkan. Game "
"itu ditagih lagi."

#: templates/official_names_review.html:132
#: templates/official_names_review.html:160 templates/versions_review.html:88
msgid "All systems"
msgstr "Semua sistem"

#: templates/official_names_review.html:139
