msgstr "Hentikan"

#: templates/official_names_review.html:152
msgid "Official Names"
msgstr "Nama Resmi"

#: templates/official_names_review.html:155
msgid ""
"The AI suggests each game's full official name, as released in the region"
" of its ROM: a Japanese ROM of Mega Man becomes Rockman. Tick the names "
"you want and accept them. The old name is kept as an alternate title, and"
" an accepted name is kept when scraping. Nothing changes until you accept"
" it."
msgstr ""
"AI menyarankan nama resmi lengkap setiap game, sesuai rilisnya di wilayah"
" ROM-nya: ROM Jepang dari Mega Man menjadi Rockman. Centang nama yang "
"Anda inginkan lalu terima. Nama lama disimpan sebagai judul alternatif, "
"dan nama yang diterima dipertahankan saat scraping. Tidak ada yang "
"berubah sampai Anda menerimanya."

