msgstr "Core pemutar"

#: templates/settings_emulators.html:93
msgid ""
"The player picks the best core for each system and downloads it from the "
"libretro build server the first time you play. Installed cores are never "
"updated by Play; update them here."
msgstr ""
"Pemutar memilih core terbaik untuk setiap sistem dan mengunduhnya dari "
"server build libretro saat pertama kali Anda bermain. Core yang terpasang"
" tidak pernah diperbarui oleh “Mainkan”; perbarui di sini."

#: templates/settings_emulators.html:98
msgid "Download a missing core when Play is pressed"
msgstr "Unduh core yang belum ada saat “Mainkan” ditekan"

