"RetroDB copies the cheat files it recognises and never changes the "
"folder. Import again to pick up new files."
msgstr ""
"RetroDB menyalin file cheat yang dikenalinya dan tidak pernah mengubah "
"folder tersebut. Impor lagi untuk mengambil file baru."

#: templates/settings_emulators.html:146
msgid "Emulator folders"
msgstr "Folder emulator"

#: templates/settings_emulators.html:150
msgid ""
"Add the folder your emulators live in. RetroDB finds each emulator there,"
